===Return to Boulder Town clinic and report to Natasha{{subst:void|<!--201140501-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Natasha's Clinic|The culprit of this invasion of the Fragmentum monsters is Cocolia's phantom &mdash; The monsters crowding between the mines and rocks all scattered after the phantom was defeated, and the crisis was officially over.<br />Gepard stated he still needs to stay at the mines to make sure things settle down. It is then up to you and Serval to report the good news to Natasha and Oleg.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Natasha)
----
:'''Natasha:''' I see... Thanks for bringing me up to speed. The clinic has been busy while you were gone. We've treated many people &mdash; soldiers and civilians alike.
:'''Natasha:''' All in all, I owe everyone a big thank you. It would've been much harder if Wildfire had operated alone.
:'''Natasha:''' Thanks to Captain Gepard, we managed to keep our losses to a minimum. I'm sure people will begin to appreciate the Silvermane Guards after this battle.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What about me?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Serval helped too!
:'''Natasha:''' Haha, how could I forget about you two? We couldn't have done it without your help.
:'''Serval:''' You're too kind, they deserve the real credit. I doubt I'd have come back in one piece without them.
:'''Natasha:''' Sounds like you went through a lot of danger... Are you hurt, Miss Serval? I can have a look if you like.
:'''Serval:''' I'm alright, don't worry! Everything worked out eventually. Let's wait for the rest of them to get back...
:'''Gepard:''' Miss Natasha, we've returned.
:'''Serval:''' Is that Gepard?
----
:'''Gepard:''' ...Mr. Oleg has a pretty good handle on what's needed in the mine.
:'''Gepard:''' He's arranging for rescue teams and supplies to be sent over. He won't be back for a while.
:'''Natasha:''' Looks like you guys have the situation under control. Thank you.
:'''Natasha:''' *sigh* I'd love to sit down and chat with all of you, but I still have a backlog of patients to see.
:'''Natasha:''' Oh, there was a girl and her brother who said you saved their lives. You might want to check on them and see how they're doing.
----
:'''Gepard:''' Natasha's right, we should make sure those children are alright.
{{Dialogue End}}

